Shadow-map resolution knob (feature).

The title creates its shadow buffer (a 256x256 cTexture) in
worldEffects_Startup_00036460 via cTexture::NewBlank(256, 256, 7, 0x100,
"ShadowBuffer", 0) (0x200B40), and the same creation is duplicated in the
sub_000364DF tail. The two width/height pushes become scghost_shadow_tex_size()
(src/recomp_shadows.c), driven by SCGHOST_SHADOW_TEX / SCGHOST_SHADOW_TEX_SCALE
(default 256). Safe because tRenderCamera::SetRenderTarget (0x1EFD30) takes the
camera canvas from the texture's own +0x34/+0x36, so the shadow pass viewport
follows.

Applied by scripts/26-apply-game-patches.sh; regenerated trees lose it.

